# ---- added 2026-09-13, when the workspace MOVED into this folder ----
# Until today this repo held only the site and the workspace lived in
# ~/Downloads. Now they are the same folder, so everything the workspace
# carries has to be named here or `git add .` publishes it.
#
# NOTE TO WHOEVER EDITS THIS: git does NOT support a trailing comment on a
# pattern line. `7dolla/   # photos` is a literal pattern that matches nothing,
# which is exactly how the first version of this block silently failed.

# the built brief — the HANDOFF*.md rule above only covers .md
handoff-prompt.html
# the workspace's own README. There is no public README.md any more — it was deleted
# 2026-09-13 at the owner's instruction and must not come back.
README-WORKSPACE.md

